# Security boundary: this directory also contains the private legacy build.
# Keep the repository deny-by-default and explicitly allow only clean-room work.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!docs/
!docs/**
!tools/
!tools/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!.github/
!.github/**

# Local reports and caches stay private.
artifacts/
tmp/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
tools/**/bin/
tools/**/obj/
